    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpiralGo is a turn-based, casino-style variation of the Chinese board game Go. This version is infused with strategic betting, modern game mechanics, and fun animations. The traditional player-vs-player format is replaced by a semi-automated system: the casino (Black) places a set number of stones automatically, while you, the human player (White), wager on how many of your stones will be placed in each iteration. The casino challenges your guesses with unpredictable but patterned stone placement. Each round begins at the center of the board (aka 'tengen'). Both players place their stones in a clockwise <strong>spiral</strong> (hence, the name).</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpiralGo is a turn-based, casino-style variation of the Chinese board game Go. This version is infused with strategic betting, modern game mechanics, and fun animations. The traditional player-vs-player format is replaced by a semi-automated system: the casino (Black) places a set number of stones automatically, while you, the human player (White), wager on how many of your stones will be placed in each iteration. The casino challenges your guesses with unpredictable but patterned stone placement. Each round begins at the center of the board (aka 'tengen'). Both players place their stones in a clockwise <strong>spiral</strong> (hence, the name).</p>",
    "short_description": "SpiralGo is a turn-based, casino-style twist on Go. Bet against the house, predict spiral stone patterns, and try to outsmart the casino! Risk, reward, and strategy collide in this minimalist board game with a gambling soul. No real money betting involved. Just some wholesome spiral fun!",
